  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#36f\"><strong>此模組已合併至 Amendments</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>Carpeted</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Carpeted 是一個非常簡單的模組，允許玩家將地毯放置在階梯和半磚的頂部。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組僅新增一個方塊，並能自動與任何階梯／半磚或任何地毯組合搭配使用，包含其他模組的內容。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">要製作地毯階梯，只需將地毯物品放置於任何朝上的階梯方塊上即可。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若要移除，只需像平常一樣破壞該方塊即可。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以上就是全部內容啦！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">開發模組花費了我大量時間，如果您喜歡我的作品並希望支持我，可以在此進行贊助。贊助後，您將獲得專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>或<strong>雕像</strong>！若您使用代碼「supplementaries」在 Akliz 購買伺服器，同樣享有此優惠。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？來看看 Akliz，他們提供專為模組版 Minecraft 打造的高品質伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們的社群氛圍溫馨，客服支援出色，伺服器效能卓越。<br>使用代碼「supplementaries」可享<strong>&nbsp;八折優惠</strong>，同時也能間接支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
